{'symbol': 'SIVB', 'date': '2021-09-08 10:21:00', 'title': 'NEW ENERGY EQUITY CLOSES $50 MILLION UNITRANCHE REVOLVER LED BY SVB', 'text': 'ANNAPOLIS, MD., SEPT. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NEW ENERGY EQUITY, A DEVELOPER AND FINANCIER OF COMMUNITY AND COMMERCIAL SOLAR PROJECTS THROUGHOUT THE UNITED STATES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE CLOSING OF A $50 MILLION FACILITY, WITH $41 MILLION LED BY SILICON VALLEY BANK AND JOINED BY SVB CAPITAL, TWO INNOVATIVE FINANCIAL PARTNERS IN THE RENEWABLE ENERGY AND TECHNOLOGY SECTOR.'}